 l Marsden Cancer Charity.\nPrice: Free to walk through. Dedicating a ros
 e starts at a suggested £15 minimum donation\nhttps://www.royalmarsden.
 org/ever-after-garden
LOCATION:Duke of York Square\, Duke of York Square\, Chelsea\, London SW3
  4LY\, Chelsea\, London
URL:https://www.royalmarsden.org/ever-after-garden
END:VEVENT
